author ai
group map
note The io-vcs crate: how the tool reaches version control. jj when a .jj directory is at or above the root, else git when a .git is, so a repo colocated with git is jj's. Only through the command line (io-process runs the program), never a library. Two questions are asked of it: the map at the parent revision, for diff, and one source file at a revision, for repin. The parent is @- in jj and HEAD in git. wire.rs holds the command lines and parses git's tree listing; convert.rs turns them into io-process arguments and program output into domain text. Every failure is a VcsError value; the callers turn it into their own Failure.

